{"title": "Corvid Token", "pageid": 12900, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Corvid_Token", "categories": ["Amulets", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Corvid Token image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Corvid Token</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> that increases <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">jump</a> distance and <a href=\"/wiki/Flight_(Condition)\" title=\"Flight (Condition)\">flying</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">speed</a>, grants the <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph:_Dire_Raven\" title=\"Polymorph: Dire Raven\">Polymorph: Dire Raven</a> action, and grants <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a> to the wearer, which persists while <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph\" title=\"Polymorph\">Polymorphed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shaped</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>'Let your lips turn black as night/On this eve of frightful wights/Let your throat be filled with screams/Nearby looms the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Queen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raven Queen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Queen\">Raven Queen</a></span>!' - A song of dark festivity\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 230 gp / 360 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  230  gp /  360  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_LuckySeven_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_LuckySeven_Amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_LuckySeven_Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">95f850c6-ccaf-4f37-8c7a-33f740765ec0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:95f850c6-ccaf-4f37-8c7a-33f740765ec0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:95f850c6-ccaf-4f37-8c7a-33f740765ec0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph:_Dire_Raven\" title=\"Polymorph: Dire Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp/60px-Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp/80px-Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph: Dire Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Wild_Shape_Dire_Raven_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph:_Dire_Raven\" title=\"Polymorph: Dire Raven\">Polymorph: Dire Raven</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Take the shape of a dire raven that can avoid attention and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blind</a></span> enemies. It has <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"HP Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span> 13 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_the_Raven_Queen\" title=\"Boon of the Raven Queen\">Boon of the Raven Queen</a></dt><dd>While wearing the amulet, the wearer's jump and flying speed increase by 1.5 m / 5 ft, and they gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a> condition. Feather Fall's effect will persist while the wearer is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild-Shaped</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Feather_Fall\"> Condition: Feather Fall </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Rate of falling is slowed, granting <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Immunity</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;56&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-120</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mattis\" title=\"Mattis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/25px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/38px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/50px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mattis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/25px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mattis\" title=\"Mattis\">Mattis</a> near the <a href=\"/wiki/Requisitioned_Barn\" title=\"Requisitioned Barn\">Requisitioned Barn</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Boon of the Raven Queen:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Boon of the Raven Queen triggers the condition when any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Beast Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Beast_Shape_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorph Beast Shape (status group)\">Polymorph Beast Shape</a></span> status group is applied.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195859\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2865/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50642/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15721/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1406605/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.426      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   79.426      1 -total\n 25.20%   20.019      9 Template:Icon_text\n 22.15%   17.595     26 Template:Trim\n 16.69%   13.260      4 Template:Icon_link\n 15.18%   12.060      1 Template:SpellAction\n 13.22%   10.498     10 Template:Ifempty\n 12.80%   10.167      2 Template:Uid\n 11.54%    9.165      1 Template:FRWiki\n  8.63%    6.852      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12900-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195859 and revision id 293596. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}